<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><link href="https://zovo.one/favicon.ico" rel="icon"><meta charset="utf-8"> <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Depreciation Calculator | Free Online Tool</title> <link rel="canonical" href="https://zovo.one/free-tools/depreciation-calculator/"><meta content="Free depreciation calculator with MACRS, straight-line, double declining balance, and sum-of-years-digits methods. Generate full depreciation schedules, comp." name="description"><meta content="Michael Lip" name="author"><meta content="index, follow" name="robots"><meta content="depreciation calculator, MACRS depreciation, straight-line depreciation, double declining balance, sum of years digits, Section 179, bonus depreciation, depreciation schedule, tax depreciation" name="keywords"><meta content="Depreciation Calculator - Free MACRS, Straight-Line, DDB Schedule | Zovo Tools" property="og:title"><meta content="Free depreciation calculator with MACRS, straight-line, double declining balance, and sum-of-years-digits methods. Full schedules, method comparison, and Section 179 deductions." property="og:description"><meta content="website" property="og:type"><meta content="https://zovo.one/free-tools/depreciation-calculator/" property="og:url"><meta content="Zovo" property="og:site_name"><meta content="https://zovo.one/og-image.png" property="og:image"><meta content="summary_large_image" name="twitter:card"><meta content="Depreciation Calculator - Free MACRS, Straight-Line, DDB Schedule | Zovo Tools" name="twitter:title"><meta content="Free depreciation calculator with MACRS, straight-line, double declining balance, and sum-of-years-digits methods. Full schedules, method comparison, and Section 179 deductions." name="twitter:description"><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"><link crossorigin="" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect"><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;5